  "source_sha256": "55b8e434ee7aadb6234c476aee150f83f88f5c3c8f674a65b6a263e487f9b55e",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "94b7daf7cb6b3b2f264ba9b26a02772eaad5c6ba5b8d7bdc4aece22db2c48069",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nWibble-Wobble\nRide",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "48becfac5b38a515bfcca4b02b87e7aa7e19ed2902abed069d7db81bfe8745eb",
      "text": "“Look at them go!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!\n“I want to ride, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dc024782dd1b47dc511665a71aeb9c69140c7e8698d93eba29945c99f7223de9",
      "text": "Wukong put on his helmet.\n“Ready!”\n“Um… it’s backward!”\nWukong giggled.\n“Let’s try again!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e4b2689883af9e5d0031069e330f94c2c5c249fd07059bb2b5d79390f1aae474",
      "text": "He pushed with his feet.\nScoot. Scoot. Scoot.\n“Look! My bike is a scooter!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ef8cdeb73893b8a6938d75619acea61219b20699ce098d8b5ba123fab59ce8d1",
      "text": "Feet up…\nWibble! Wobble!\nPLOP!\n“Hello, grass.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "59bf9f9f2a786d8d68db375dadffb31a913abbbd11c2ba99348af3ebfbcdc66b",
      "text": "“Maybe the bell will help.”\nDing! Ding!\nThe bell rang.\nHe still wobbled.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "60d438a3553b2bbd42d58dcf2dbba97b20f7f01b53a2716962ae4ecdedb3744a",
      "text": "Pigsy held the seat.\n“Eyes ahead. Nice and slow.”\nJade cheered.\n“You can do it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0d8125d5b84c2aafc0b32ad93f4cae4f67b0cb1b8939eb830dbd4378c0ab587a",
      "text": "Wukong tried again.\nHe pushed one pedal.\nThen the other.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "329e18af84c236e40efe6bb4c7b0264e98dc8fe04b4541aa326f2902ec2924b3",
      "text": "He wobbled left.\nHis tail wobbled right.\n“My tail is learning, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ad320497488bf3a24d154bdc48d714d496f7ed7e980eddcb656823294da1f2c9",
      "text": "He tried a little every day.\nSome rides were short.\nSome were wobbly.\nHe kept trying.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3f182dbcc206ab2fb8aad2e183f19d193f8d242a6b5067b65af01eedb24c3230",
      "text": "Then, one evening…\nPigsy let go.\nWukong kept going!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8f684fb5c481ed461e4055b2649a3f939796e29f007d7b281b03a6b29eb59d04",
      "text": "“I’m doing it!”\nHis scarf waved behind him.\nHis tail made a loop.\nHe felt so proud!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "461a4276463f7500a476db3b2e54ea4f6f9da57e72a6e43f3ff00cb21bd75280",
      "text": "He learned to turn.\nHe learned to stop.\nHe stopped before a puddle.\n“After you, little duck.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ac98abb5cd786a9e0ea0a3bdd97456693d0a51a879a26b5a6e0c7df909fbf537",
      "text": "Now they rode together.\nNo rush.\nJust happy wheels.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c73488bb042001ad97d1ec5f11881e963da2e8d3a20cefb8cca06840befef9a8",
      "text": "At home, he parked his bike.\n“Goodnight, wheels.”\n“Goodnight, wobbles.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3c512d6d4c53bdb2423db1680b0e6a0864fc7f94047cd21ff3ce21cd69a28072",
      "text": "Wukong curled up in bed.\nIn his dreams,\nthe path was smooth.\nAnd the wheels whispered,\n“Shhh…”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
